    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus-infra"
      },
      "description": "Trace payload bytes ingested by Tempo's distributor, one bar per UTC calendar day (increase over a 1d step). Primary 'data received by the system' signal — watch daily volume against the Tempo storage budget. The current day's bar is partial and grows until UTC midnight.",
